WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:36.380
Can't you drive better?

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:40.050
It can't be helped.
Last time I drove was 16 years ago.

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:40.970
Sixteen years?

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:43.520
Do you have a license?

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:46.600
You worry about the dumbest stuff.

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:49.940
I've got an errand
before we go to the Shoshidai.

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:51.440
You're coming with me.

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:13.300
You're Kei... right?

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:16.470
Seiya.

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:18.510
Welcome home!

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:22.260
Yeah, I'm home.

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:25.850
I'm making some tea right now.

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:27.230
Thanks.

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:31.230
The roses are still so pretty.

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:36.570
Yes. They say roses have always been
a symbol of restored youth.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:42.620
That's why they always look so young,
their beauty never changes.

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:47.660
How have you been?
Like, gotten married or anything?

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:49.410
Married?

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:54.340
Please, tell me the truth. It's my fault
for leaving you alone for so long.

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:58.550
Is this some kind of joke?

00:02:58.630 --> 00:02:59.470
Joke?

00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:02.590
We're together every day, aren't we?

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:05.510
We saw a movie together yesterday, right?

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:07.430
Yesterday?

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:10.940
-What's going on--
-Yeah, I was just joking.

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:15.980
He's from the country,
so he doesn't understand city jokes.

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:21.490
I'm sorry, he can be so funny.

00:03:24.490 --> 00:03:25.330
Hey.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:29.000
Who's the old lady?

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:31.790
My girlfriend.

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:33.040
Girlfriend?

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:36.840
I suppose now is a good time to explain.

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:42.130
We Chrysalises, those possessed
by weapons, will someday become Busoma.

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:44.970
Busoma.

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:49.730
Will it happen to me?

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:54.730
Eventually. So to delay that,
we go into cold sleep at the Shoshidai.

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:56.270
Cold sleep?

00:03:57.230 --> 00:03:59.230
We literally sleep in the ice.

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:02.650
We don't even dream.
A complete and total shutdown.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:07.830
We're kept preserved,
and awaken only when our power is needed.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.670
Like I mentioned before,
it's been 16 years since I was last out.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:17.130
Obviously,
I didn't see Kei that entire time.

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:20.050
I don't even know
how long it was before that.

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:23.880
But it's probably been as long
as this time.

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:28.810
When we met in high school,
Kei was one year younger than me.

00:04:29.180 --> 00:04:30.970
But when I became a Chrysalis...

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:34.020
I had to go into cold sleep.

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:41.570
You don't age when you sleep.

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.900
Time stopped for me,

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:45.610
but Kei...

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:49.660
Still, she didn't question it.

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:52.950
She probably knew
she couldn't ask about it.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:58.540
In fact, the rules are you can't
tell civilians about the Shoshidai.

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:04.840
Most people would immediately give up
on a monster like me,

00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:07.430
but Kei always waited for me.

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:10.060
Just like now.

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:16.810
That being said, you're in the way.

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:18.230
Get lost.

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:19.560
What?

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:25.280
Oh?

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:27.110
Where's your friend?

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:29.870
He didn't want to bother us, so he left.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:32.870
It’s time for romance.

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:34.450
Oh my.

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:40.840
Hurry! Hurry!

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:45.340
SWORD SOULS

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:47.260
Sword Souls?

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:51.050
<i>It's time for the climax of today's event!</i>

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:54.640
<i>Sword Souls,
<i>a player versus player fighting game...</i></i>

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:57.690
<i>is about to have its final match!</i>

00:05:57.770 --> 00:05:59.190
FINAL MATCH

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:05.440
<i>Our first player is this man,</i>

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:09.160
<i>the lucky guy who won the right</i>

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:12.950
<i>to challenge the defending champion
<i>and beautiful idol, Midoriko!</i></i>

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:17.330
<i>Now for what you've waited for!</i>

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:22.960
<i>The beautiful genius gamer
<i>Midoriko is here!</i></i>

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:30.890
<i>Will the muse of combat be able
<i>to defend her champion's seat once more?</i></i>

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:34.350
<i>Now let the game...</i>

00:06:35.850 --> 00:06:36.680
<i>start!</i>

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:40.060
Here we go!

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:48.070
<i>Whoa! Starting off with a triple combo!
<i>Midoriko's looking strong today!</i></i>

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:50.490
<i>Will he be able to counterattack?</i>

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:53.410
You better attack,
or I'll slice you to ribbons!

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:54.950
Come on, come on, come on!

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:57.660
<i>Oh, it's just a game, huh?</i>

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:00.750
Hey, I want to get out!

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:04.290
Die! Ka-boom!

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:07.380
<i>There it is!</i>

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:09.930
<i>Midoriko wins flawlessly!</i>

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:12.640
<i>The gaming gods bless this beautiful girl!</i>

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:15.850
<i>Can anybody end her reign of victory?</i>

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:19.180
Thank you everyone!

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:23.310
As thanks for your support,
I'll sing my new song!

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:25.520
"Lunatic Angel in Blue"!

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:27.440
Please enjoy!

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:41.290
This song brings back memories.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.630
I still remember how shocked I was.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:49.590
You suddenly knocked
my dance partner's lights out!

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:53.510
The girl I loved was in another man’s arms
at the school dance.

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:55.220
Anyone would've done so.

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:57.430
I felt bad for my cousin.

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:02.600
But because of your misunderstanding,
we started dating.

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:05.730
To me, this is a special song.

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:06.980
Yeah.

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:14.490
-Hey, when you met me--
-Ow!

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:15.740
Sorry!

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:17.410
Are you okay?

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:18.490
Yes.

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:25.080
Thank you.

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:28.670
I can't paint my toenails properly myself.

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:32.510
If there's anything else
you want me to do, just ask.

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:34.130
You're so kind.

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:38.010
Of course. Have I ever been otherwise?

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:40.600
Let's see...

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:43.310
At the amusement park,

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:47.110
you made me ride the roller coaster
against my will, right?

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:49.360
You weren't nice then at all.

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:52.490
You were in tears.

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:56.160
And when we made
that Christmas cake together,

00:08:56.240 --> 00:09:02.000
you put in the wrong amount of flour,
and tried to blame it on me!

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:04.750
That wasn't nice either.

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:07.540
What, are you still mad about that?

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:11.050
But it was different
when we went to the lake.

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:17.260
When the wind blew away my hat, you swam
in the lake during winter to get it back.

00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:19.140
That was very nice of you.

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:20.470
Yeah.

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:22.310
I got a nasty cold though.

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:28.270
There's still so many places
I want to go with you!

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:31.400
The movie theater,
the hot springs we went to once...

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:32.690
A beach in Hawaii!

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:33.990
Paris!

00:09:35.240 --> 00:09:37.860
And I want to go back to that lake.

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:40.620
All of that? You're asking for a lot.

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:44.750
I am not. We're still in our twenties.

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:49.210
We've got a long, long time
until we're old.

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:54.130
Want to go now?
If you're fine with the lake.

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:55.050
Really?

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:56.550
That's wonderful!

00:09:57.130 --> 00:09:58.930
I'll go get ready!

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:10.980
<i>The person you have dialed
<i>cannot come to the phone.</i></i>

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:13.610
<i>Please leave a message after the beep.</i>

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:16.570
<i>This is your care worker, Ishikawa.</i>

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:19.570
<i>Have you considered the hospital,
<i>I talked about?</i></i>

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:24.120
<i>The doctor said you might not survive
<i>another attack like that.</i></i>

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:27.370
<i>It's dangerous to continue living alone.</i>

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:30.210
<i>You need to decide on a home to go to.</i>

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:32.460
<i>Either way, I'll call back.</i>

00:10:57.690 --> 00:10:58.820
An illusion.

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:04.780
You're not the real Seiya.

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:07.450
You're just an illusion.

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:12.000
But I don't care.

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:31.940
I'm so tired.

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:33.560
I'm sorry, Midoriko.

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:36.900
They're out of your usual ice cream.
Just this.

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:42.780
What the hell? As old as you are,
you can't even buy ice cream?

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:45.870
I'm so bored! So bored!

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:48.580
There's no point in being alive!

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.870
-Where are you going?
-To pee.

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:01.170
Midoriko, s-sorry if I scared you.

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:05.600
I really wanted to talk to you,
since I didn't get to back there.

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:08.680
I just wanted to thank you.

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:15.770
A year ago, I was on the brink of suicide.

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:20.530
I was blamed for some problems at work
and had to quit.

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:23.660
But your smile saved me.

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:25.990
I told myself,

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:29.990
"If a girl can smile this brightly,
maybe the world's not so bad!"

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:33.540
I started to feel optimistic again,
and got a new job!

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:35.630
It's all thanks to you!

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:38.920
To me, you're a real angel!

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:44.050
Why?

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:49.140
Why do people like you
always say the same things?

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:52.730
An angel? A goddess?
I'm sick of hearing that.

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:57.810
Can't you come up with anything else?
Are you stupid? Well, are you stupid?

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:01.570
You're such a bore.

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:19.130
A body... a new body...

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:28.850
That was an amazing playing today.
Can you tell me the secret to your power?

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:31.060
There isn't one.

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:33.520
It's all just really boring.

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:36.980
I rip them apart and feel a little better.

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:45.400
What's making you depressed?

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:49.950
If something's bothering you,
I want to help!

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:52.950
Just like how you saved me!

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:57.710
Stop it!

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:09.010
Die! Come on, die!

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:12.220
Your back's wide open!

00:14:12.310 --> 00:14:14.640
I'll slice you to ribbons!

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:16.430
Come on, come on, come on!

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:22.980
What? Did you snap?

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:36.120
Save! Save! Save! Save!

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:40.210
I'll save you!
Save! Save! Save! Save!

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:47.130
<i>Take me in your hand.</i>

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:52.640
<i>And you can become something
<i>more than human.</i></i>

00:14:53.930 --> 00:14:54.760
<i>Take me.</i>

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:56.770
<i>Come on, take me!</i>

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:15.280
Hey, be careful you don't trip!

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:18.540
I'm fine! You're such a worrywart.

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:23.540
It feels so nice and cool.

00:15:26.130 --> 00:15:29.470
Hey, chase after me!
Like in a cheesy TV show!

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:32.430
I said be careful!

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:50.150
See? I told you.

00:15:57.660 --> 00:16:00.080
Who are you?

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:04.290
Kei! Kei!

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:08.210
-Let's go to the hospital.
-Please...

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:11.130
take me home.

00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:16.600
Die, wimps!

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:18.180
Ka-boom!

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:22.350
It's fine! I'll destroy it all!

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:25.060
I'm Midoriko, the super-strong girl!

00:16:26.270 --> 00:16:27.440
Midoriko?

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:29.400
Who was that?

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:30.990
Well, whatever!

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:35.450
Pee!

00:16:56.800 --> 00:16:57.970
The Flamberge?

00:16:58.640 --> 00:17:00.060
Where is Seiya Ichijo?

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:02.810
He's not answering.

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:05.020
He's...

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:09.820
What's this?

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:12.320
Is it time for a mini-boss?

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:13.650
Jeez!

00:17:14.030 --> 00:17:16.360
Midoriko will get you!

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:34.090
Are you one of those Chrysalises?

00:17:39.260 --> 00:17:40.560
Let's go now.

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:46.730
Open that closet.

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:58.160
I've been waiting
for you to propose to me.

00:17:58.820 --> 00:17:59.660
I see.

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:02.030
Took a long time, huh?

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:06.000
You're the only one for me, Kei.

00:18:06.710 --> 00:18:08.580
Will you marry me?

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.010
I'm so happy!

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:19.640
Will you help me put it on?

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:20.850
Sure.

00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:27.020
Thank you.

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:31.650
Kei!

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:33.230
I'm okay.

00:18:38.490 --> 00:18:42.740
I thought you were
just a hallucination of mine.

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:47.620
You haven't changed
despite all the decades.

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:54.050
I was left behind
and got old all alone, but...

00:18:57.630 --> 00:18:59.010
I was wrong.

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:02.470
You're the real Seiya, aren't you?

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:10.100
There's something I always wanted to ask,
but couldn't.

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:14.440
Were you happy after you met me?

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:18.150
Did I ruin your life?

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:21.240
You're so silly.

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:26.160
I don't even want to think of life
without you.

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:52.810
Fine.

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:55.770
Are there any other available Chrysalises?

00:19:56.150 --> 00:19:57.070
<i>I'll go.</i>

00:19:58.030 --> 00:19:59.030
Seiya Ichijo?

00:20:10.290 --> 00:20:11.910
Die!

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:16.420
The big boss?

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:25.970
That was one hell of a combo.

00:20:32.180 --> 00:20:33.100
She ran, huh?

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:44.240
Looks like that was a close one.

00:20:45.990 --> 00:20:48.080
You want a thank you?

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:51.450
No. Sadly, I'm not in the mood.

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:53.960
Let's go.
